    "note": "Stat block and levels 1–3 on printed 4, levels 4–20 on printed 5 (PDF 3). Secondary stats STR, DEX from the Secondary Stat Increase lines. “Portable Cauldron (bucket)” mapped to Core Rules gear “Bucket” (gear.bucket); the book prints no separate cauldron item. Weapons “Blades”: blade is undefined in the Core Rules (RQ-008), so the blade proficiency matches nothing yet. Afflictions pool PDF 4, printed 6; Mystic Marks pool PDF 4, printed 7. retrainText (Bubble, Bubble!) is the sidebar on printed 4."
